msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Swamps"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"\"Nemain the Mire Witch traps any who dare trespass in her domain beneath "
"the mire, never to return again.  She specializes in wearing her foes down "
"over time, harassing and slowing them down until poison and disease cause "
"them to collapse in the filth and muck.\""

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Sol'kanar the Swamp King"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Harness the power of the swamp, slow anybody foolish enough to enter your "
"domain, and drown them in its ichor."

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Swampkin"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Become one with what lies beneath the swamp, granting the race:[Bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]2 {Blight} {GLOBAL.BlightResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]"
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SWAMP_CAMOUFLAGE.Hyperlink} in swamps and rivers[bullet/]"
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SWAMP_WALK.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SWIFT."
"Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@UNIT1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Testing"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Summon River Troll"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Summons a river troll on target swamp hex or river tile."

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Inflict Rot"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Units in a 1 hex radius sustain:[bulletlist][bullet/]10 {GLOBAL."
"BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Suffer {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POISONED."
"Hyperlink}[bullet/]Suffer {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WEAKENED.Hyperlink}[bullet/]"
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DECAYING.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Bring the Floodplains"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target friendly above-ground city starts altering terrain to Swamp 1 "
"province per {GLOBAL.TurnConcept}.[bulletlist][bullet/]The spell extends up "
"to 1 <<m:{GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}>> outside the {GLOBAL."
"DomainConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]While the spell is active, provinces with "
"Swamp provide +1 {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} and +1 {GLOBAL."
"UnitProductionConcept.Hyperlink} income.[/bulletlist]\n"
"This terraform effect slowly disappears should this city spell be removed."

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Drown in the Mire"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"All units in target enemy army:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sustain {blightDamage} "
"{GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Suffer the {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.POISONED.Hyperlink} status effect.[/bulletlist][br/][br/]Armies "
"in a Swamp additionally sustain:[bulletlist][bullet/]An additional "
"{additional} {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]An additional 2x "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POISONED.Hyperlink} Status Effect"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_6@NAME"
msgstr "Hag-Touched"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@SKILL_6@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Enchanted Units gain:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SWIFT."
"Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]\n"
"Makes base {GLOBAL.MagicConcept.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.RangedConcept."
"Hyperlink} attacks of enchanted units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Deal +1 {GLOBAL."
"BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Base 30% chance of inflicting "
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STATUS_VULNERABILITY.Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for non-repeating attacks."

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@HERO_SKILL@NAME"
msgstr "Hag-Touched Magic"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@HERO_SKILL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Base attacks gain: [bulletlist][bullet/]+1{GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink}.[bullet/]A base 30% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"STATUS_VULNERABILITY.Hyperlink},\n"
"Effects [hyperlink,GLOBAL.EnchantingNonRepeatingConcept]are increased[/"
"hyperlink] for non-repeating attacks."

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@NAME"
msgstr "[farm/] Witch's Cottage"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+{knowledgeamount} {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink}."
"[bullet/]+{manaamount} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent Swamp "
"{GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.FarmConcept."
"Hyperlink}.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of the Great Mire"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In my kingdom, all things return to the marsh. We are borne of the swamp. "
"The swamp nourishes us. We wither, and feed her in return. You are not from "
"here, interloper, but you will still make excellent fertilizer for the "
"maggots writhing in my earth."

msgid "TOME_MIRE@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Nemain, the Mire Witch"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Reduce your foe's movements to nothing but a slow crawl while disease and "
"pestilence bring them to their knees. The swamp will reclaim any who dare "
"enter its murky waters."

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "Summon Swamp Troll"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Summons a swamp troll on target swamp hex or river tile of owned city."

msgid "TOME_MIRE@UNIT1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "PLACEHOLDER"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Sink the Land"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target {GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept.Hyperlink}:[bulletlist][bullet/]Is destroyed."
"[bullet/]Turns into a swamp.[bullet/]Units within suffer the {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.POISONED.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BOGGED.Hyperlink} "
"status conditions.[/bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Blight Boil"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Enemy unit suffering from {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POISONED.Hyperlink} explodes in "
"a shower of toxins, inflicting {blightDamage} {GLOBAL.BlightDamageConcept."
"Hyperlink} to itself and adjacent enemies and spreading {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"POISONED.Hyperlink} to them."

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Trollhide"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Ingest the blood of trolls, granting the race:[bulletlist][bullet/]+2 "
"{GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"TROLL_REGENERATION.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]-3 [defensefire/] [hyperlink,GLOBAL."
"FireResistanceConcept]Fire Resistance[/hyperlink][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DEMOLISHER.Hyperlink}[bullet/]Immune to the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.DISEASED."
"Hyperlink} condition."

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Mass Enervation"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"All enemy units suffer {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POISONED.Hyperlink}, {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.WEAKENED.Hyperlink}, and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BOGGED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_6@NAME"
msgstr "Brew Plague"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_6@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"At the start of battle, enemy units:[bulletlist][bullet/]Sustain 5 {GLOBAL."
"BlightDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Suffer the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DECAYING.Hyperlink} (for 2 turns) and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.POISONED.Hyperlink} "
"status conditions."

msgid "TOME_MIRE@HERO_SKILL@NAME"
msgstr "Grasp of the Mire"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@HERO_SKILL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target enemy unit is inflicted with:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DECAYING.Hyperlink} with a 90% chance. Inflict 3x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"POISONED.Hyperlink} if not successful[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.BOGGED."
"Hyperlink} with a 90% chance. Inflict {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.SLOWED.Hyperlink} "
"if not successful."

msgid "TOME_MIRE@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@NAME"
msgstr "[Conduit/] Fen Apothecary"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+{manaamount} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}."
"[bullet/]+{manaamount2} {GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink} and +{foodamount} "
"{GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} per adjacent Swamp {GLOBAL.ProvinceConcept."
"Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.ConduitConcept.Hyperlink}.[/"
"bulletlist]"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@BOGGED@NAME"
msgstr "Bogged Down"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@BOGGED@MODIFIER"
msgstr ""
"Base {BOGGED_RESISTANCE>ResolvedStrength}% chance of inflicting {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.BOGGED.Hyperlink}, for 3 <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept}>>."

msgid "TOME_MIRE@BOGGED@Description"
msgstr "This unit gains Super Slow Movement (Set to 16.)"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@SKILL_4@ALTERNATE_NAME"
msgstr "Trollhide - No Visuals"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@NEMAIN@NAME"
msgstr "Nemain Scathanna"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@NEMAIN@LASTNAME"
msgstr "Scathanna"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@NEMAIN@TITLE"
msgstr "Mire Witch"

msgid "TOME_MIRE@NEMAIN@RACE"
msgstr "Bog Drowned"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@TOME@PASSIVE_NAME"
msgstr "Swamp Preference"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@TOME@PASSIVE_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Princes with Swamp gives you +2 {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink}"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@TOME@PASSIVE2_NAME"
msgstr "Swamp Farming"

msgid "TOME_SWAMPS@TOME@PASSIVE2_DESC"
msgstr ""
"Remove {GLOBAL.FoodConcept.Hyperlink} penalty from <<m:{GLOBAL.FarmConcept."
"Hyperlink}>> in Swamp Provinces\n"
"\n"
"<<m:{GLOBAL.FarmConcept.Hyperlink}>> on Swamp terrain gain +5 {GLOBAL."
"FoodConcept.Hyperlink} if your race has Swamp Adaptation"
